<p>Notifications are stored mainly in <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">key</code>-<code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">value</code> form. One key point to emphasize: notifications are stored along two dimensions — <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">name</code> and <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">object</code> — which correspond to the two different parameters we pass when adding a notification.</p>

